The AI tab is gone: it only repeated the win probability and run rates you can already see.

Match Overview is cleaner. Each card now matches the rest of the app, and nothing is shown twice. Phases, fall of wickets, reviews and head to head are plain lists, the worm marks each wicket, and a new runs-per-over chart replaces the second run-rate graph. Reviews now show only what happened: over, batter, umpire and whether the review was upheld.
